                  "stats": {
                    "id": "levelled_description_399b539152f4",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 12
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Your limbs produce strange, sucker-like growths that allow you to adhere to walls, objects, and most other surfaces. You gain a climb Speed equal to your half your land Speed (minimum 5 feet). If you have the Quick Climb feat, your climb Speed is equal to your land Speed.\n\nIn addition, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Reflex DC to avoid being Disarmed."
